tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-2651-what-a-record-named-through-its-module-still-refuses.case/main.hero:20:17: error[dot_on_a_record_name]: `m.Pair` names a record, so `m.Pair.a` reads a field from a value that is not there — `m.Pair::a` is the NAME of that field, and `m.Pair(field: value, …)` builds one
